This utility is written for PCBoard 15.21 to pack the FIDO configuration
file PCBFIDO.CFG.

To use this program, place it in a directory which contains a copy of
PCBOARD.DAT. Make sure you make a backup copy of PCBFIDO.CFG. Then type PACKFIDO.
As records are packed out of the file. it will be noted on the screen.

